# stereo.xrs - stereo must produce two DIFFERENT eye images.
#
# Read the result with:
#   .\tools\img-diff.ps1 -A <Left> -B <Right>
# Standing-still noise is ~0.4 mean (docs/bioshock1/TESTING.md). Both eyes
# identical reads at the noise floor; real stereo reads well above it.
reset
@mod vrstereo on
@frames 60
@assert projectionViews eq 2
@shot stereo_on
